{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swim gracefully through the sea and bring your song to the darkened corals.<br><br>A 3D action-adventure game where a mermaid uses the power of her song to dispel the dark mist and restore the ocean\u2019s vibrant beauty.<br><br>Purify the darkened corals by delivering your song and restore their beauty. While a mermaid\u2019s voice alone cannot cleanse the larger corals, purifying the smaller ones will spread the effect and cleanse the connected larger corals as well. Swim swiftly through the ocean by passing through bubble rings scattered across the field to gain bursts of speed.<br><br>\u203bThis game is still under active development and will continue to receive updates.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4038810?t=1760926585","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4038810?t=1760926585","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038810/bca2b4918f5257a555e1a4f59bb1e6f3bd7da0d7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760926585","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038810/bca2b4918f5257a555e1a4f59bb1e6f3bd7da0d7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760926585","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swim gracefully through the sea and bring your song to the darkened corals.<br><br>A 3D action-adventure game where a mermaid uses the power of her song to dispel the dark mist and restore the ocean\u2019s vibrant beauty.<br><br>Purify the darkened corals by delivering your song and restore their beauty. While a mermaid\u2019s voice alone cannot cleanse the larger corals, purifying the smaller ones will spread the effect and cleanse the connected larger corals as well. Swim swiftly